                    <h2>Software Engineer – Frontend (Flutter) Intern</h2>
                    <p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote / Nigeria<br />
                        <strong>Type:</strong> Internship (Stipend Provided)
                    </p>

                    <p><strong>About the Role</strong><br />
                        We are excited to offer a Frontend Software Engineer internship for motivated students and fresh
                        graduates eager to gain hands-on experience. You'll work alongside experienced engineers to
                        build and maintain user-friendly web applications, with a focus on learning how to integrate
                        APIs and develop frontend features in a real-world environment.</p>

                    <p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Assist in developing and testing responsive web applications using modern frontend
                            technologies (Flutter and Dart).</li>
                        <li>Learn to consume and integrate RESTful APIs effectively.</li>
                        <li>Collaborate with the team to understand project requirements and deliver quality code.</li>
                        <li>Participate in code reviews and team meetings.</li>
                        <li>Troubleshoot simple frontend bugs and contribute to UI improvements.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Who We’re Looking For</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Currently enrolled in the 3rd or 4th year of a Computer Science or related degree program,
                            or a recent graduate.</li>
                        <li>Basic knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</li>
                        <li>Familiarity with frontend frameworks (Flutter and Dart) is a plus but not required.</li>
                        <li>Eagerness to learn new technologies and a proactive attitude.</li>
                        <li>Good communication skills and ability to work collaboratively.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>What We Offer</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>A monthly stipend to support your internship.</li>
                        <li>Mentorship from experienced software engineers.</li>
                        <li>Real-world experience in frontend development and API integration.</li>
                        <li>Flexible working hours and possibility to work remotely.</li>
                        <li>Opportunities to learn, grow, and contribute to meaningful projects.</li>
                    </ul>

